    "implementation_delta": "Publish KitContextPackStorage@1 as the Kit-owned persist and current-root CAS of the PCPR-061 DatasetsContextPack@1 identity. Kit verifies exact canonical identity bytes, stores them hermetically, publishes generation-1 current root bafkreihjdjarrlr24sperlq3zl4hjrksbol4b5saxquie3wpyi6xwsobwi through compare-and-swap, records DurableArtifactReceipt@1 and a root-transition receipt, and re-opens with verification while rejecting stale parents. DatasetsContextPackStorageBinding@1 and AccelerateContextPackStorageBinding@1 consume that current root without reminting DatasetsContextPack@1 pack CID bafkreih72d3nncekez43wmtlczq5mdtymzniluujypwybpgu3mtt7i4v2e. Live IPFS, live Quack, live supervisor admission, and START stay typed unavailable. Missing a live durable backend or Quack-fenced session emits operator-blocking task pcpr-062-operator-live-context-pack-root. Deterministic execution remains PCPR-063. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
